title: 'pallet-child-bounties: let RejectOrigin unassign a PendingPayout curator after parent deactivation'
doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
    description: |
      Allow `RejectOrigin` to unassign the curator of a `PendingPayout` child bounty, and slash
      their deposit, after the parent bounty has left the active state, as documented by the
      pallet. Together with the `close_child_bounty` change in #13406, this lets governance clean
      up a `PendingPayout` child without first re-staffing the parent. Signed callers still
      require the parent bounty to be active and the caller to be its curator.
      No storage migration is required.
crates:
  - name: pallet-child-bounties
    bump: patch
